      "text": "SCOOP: A group of heroic ICE officers on duty arresting illegal immigrants stumbled upon a 2-year-old wandering the streets in nothing but a heavily soiled diaper and stopped what they were doing to rescue him, @realDailyWire has learned.\n\nOfficer Michael Joyce, who is part of an ICE Nashville Fugitive Operations Team, said the young boy was standing in the middle of the parking lot when he arrived. The toddler was almost struck by a passing vehicle.\n\nThey believed the boy had been outside alone for hours.\n\nThe brave officer blocked traffic while his team called local police and located the child’s mother, who was asleep in a nearby apartment with the door wide-open.",
